{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28444","headline":"商山麻涧 · 杜牧","name":"商山麻涧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云光岚彩四面合，柔柔垂柳十余家。\n雉飞鹿过芳草远，牛巷鸡埘春日斜。\n秀眉老父对罇酒，蒨袖女儿簪野花。\n征车自念尘土计，惆怅溪边书细沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}